{"4613790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spooky Ride", "steam_appid": 4613790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your <strong>friends</strong>, hop on your <strong>bikes</strong>, and dive into this ridiculous, <strong>cozy adventure</strong>. But watch it - stray off the path and you're lost for good. Sticking together is the only way home: crack the puzzles, stay alert for hidden clues, uncover secret passages untouched for centuries, and <strong>make it through all the way to the end.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/5b2f4cb353a20128866280e505b698d2.poster.avif?t=1787564233\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/5b2f4cb353a20128866280e505b698d2.webm?t=1787564233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/5b2f4cb353a20128866280e505b698d2.mp4?t=1787564233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/ac70796fd4daff17f18e7f39bbd540d4.avif?t=1787564233\" width=1001 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was supposed to be a normal bike trip with your squad. Okay, fine, the trail was on the edge of a wild, slightly creepy National Park, still nobody saw <strong>THIS</strong> coming. <strong>Bigfoot</strong> doesn't just show up in your face on a random Tuesday.. And just like that, your chill summer break turns into a desperate mission to <strong>find your way home</strong>… and everything went completely sideways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/b690a7f5b01d7f9515a9719198132859.poster.avif?t=1787564233\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/b690a7f5b01d7f9515a9719198132859.webm?t=1787564233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/b690a7f5b01d7f9515a9719198132859.mp4?t=1787564233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/9dd8befcbdc85f1e7ce0ecdde1cd8f1b.avif?t=1787564233\" width=1001 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the forest, a legendary Bigfoot has lost its kid, a little sweet troublemaker known as <strong>Little Bigfoot</strong>. It's got a temper and some <strong>magical powers</strong>, too, so watch out. Now its fate (and your ride home) is entirely up to you and your crew. Will you make it through together, or will you get stuck in this weird world forever?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/9dd4cf165118b9661e0fab5bdaf53e27.poster.avif?t=1787564233\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/9dd4cf165118b9661e0fab5bdaf53e27.webm?t=1787564233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/9dd4cf165118b9661e0fab5bdaf53e27.mp4?t=1787564233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/56ea3ece2b1e83043707ffc71e153fc7.avif?t=1787564233\" width=1001 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spooky Ride</strong> - adventure vibes with a little edge. A cozy <strong>co-op</strong> puzzle-adventure for 1-4 players: exploration, obstacles, monsters, puzzles, and, most importantly, teamwork across gorgeously designed levels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op for 1-4 Players &amp; Voice Chat:</strong> Team up with your friends using built-in voice chat: full immersion guaranteed. Stick together, talk it out, and coordinate, because the danger is always around the corner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/7fb4135aff1bf0034ce9f910baeff245.poster.avif?t=1787564233\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/7fb4135aff1bf0034ce9f910baeff245.webm?t=1787564233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/7fb4135aff1bf0034ce9f910baeff245.mp4?t=1787564233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy  and sometimes tricky Puzzles:</strong> Environmental, logical, logistical - you'll be planning your moves, activating ancient mechanisms, and navigating tricky natural and unnatural terrains. Figuring it out is half the fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4613790/extras/40e9f318c98fe20dc4793c558ee120f4.poster.avif?t=1787564233\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste